1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,224
Counting 1 to 10 with Mimo!

2
00:00:05,846 --> 00:00:11,673
Mimo: Hi friends! It's me, Mimo! Today we're going to count all the way to ten!

3
00:00:13,273 --> 00:00:19,496
Mimo: Can you count with me? Hold up your fingers! Let's start in my garden.

4
00:00:19,796 --> 00:00:24,659
Mimo: Look! My carrots are ready! Let's count them as I pick them.

5
00:00:25,759 --> 00:00:26,646
Mimo: One!

6
00:00:28,246 --> 00:00:29,013
Mimo: Two!

7
00:00:30,613 --> 00:00:31,475
Mimo: Three!

8
00:00:33,075 --> 00:00:33,929
Mimo: Four!

9
00:00:35,529 --> 00:00:36,471
Mimo: Five!

10
00:00:38,571 --> 00:00:41,938
Mimo: Five carrots! Great counting, friends!

11
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:45,667
Bruno: Ooh! Carrots! They look so crunchy!

12
00:00:45,967 --> 00:00:49,699
Mimo: Bruno, we're counting them. Please don't eat them!

13
00:00:49,999 --> 00:00:52,347
Bruno: Okay, okay. I'll just... look at them.

14
00:00:52,647 --> 00:00:55,887
Mimo: Now let's count my flowers over here...

15
00:01:02,151 --> 00:01:07,656
Mimo: Hey! Wait a minute! How many carrots are there now? Let's count again!

16
00:01:07,956 --> 00:01:08,843
Mimo: One!

17
00:01:09,443 --> 00:01:10,211
Mimo: Two!

18
00:01:10,811 --> 00:01:11,672
Mimo: Three!

19
00:01:12,272 --> 00:01:13,127
Mimo: Four!

20
00:01:13,727 --> 00:01:17,153
Mimo: Four?! There were five carrots! Bruno!

21
00:01:17,453 --> 00:01:20,938
Bruno: Hee hee. Five minus one is four! I was helping you learn!

22
00:01:23,238 --> 00:01:27,088
Mimo: Silly Bruno! Okay, let's go to the park!

23
00:01:29,588 --> 00:01:33,252
Pip: Look, everybody! It's a balloon party! Let's count the balloons!

24
00:01:33,552 --> 00:01:34,425
Pip: One!

25
00:01:35,225 --> 00:01:36,316
Lulu: Two!

26
00:01:37,116 --> 00:01:37,827
Pip: Three!

27
00:01:38,627 --> 00:01:39,385
Lulu: Four!

28
00:01:40,185 --> 00:01:40,884
Pip: Five!

29
00:01:41,684 --> 00:01:42,576
Lulu: Six!

30
00:01:43,376 --> 00:01:44,212
Pip: Seven!

31
00:01:46,312 --> 00:01:52,537
Lulu: Seven balloons! Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, purple and pink!

32
00:01:52,837 --> 00:01:55,823
Pip: I love balloons! I'm going to hold ALL of them!

33
00:02:00,838 --> 00:02:03,344
Pip: Whoa! Whoa! The balloons are lifting me up!

34
00:02:03,644 --> 00:02:06,414
Lulu: Hold on, Pip! I'll save you!

35
00:02:09,389 --> 00:02:13,478
Pip: Phew. Thanks, Lulu. Are all the balloons still here? Let's count!

36
00:02:13,778 --> 00:02:14,470
Lulu: One!

37
00:02:15,070 --> 00:02:16,161
Lulu: Two!

38
00:02:16,761 --> 00:02:17,645
Lulu: Three!

39
00:02:18,245 --> 00:02:19,004
Lulu: Four!

40
00:02:19,604 --> 00:02:20,415
Lulu: Five!

41
00:02:21,015 --> 00:02:21,907
Lulu: Six!

42
00:02:22,507 --> 00:02:23,362
Lulu: Seven!

43
00:02:23,962 --> 00:02:26,530
Lulu: Seven! All the balloons are safe!

44
00:02:26,830 --> 00:02:29,039
Pip: Maybe I'll just hold one next time.

45
00:02:33,539 --> 00:02:38,357
Mimo: Look up at the sky, everybody. The stars are coming out!

46
00:02:38,657 --> 00:02:41,778
Lulu: Let's count the stars! All the way to ten!

47
00:02:42,078 --> 00:02:42,965
Mimo: One!

48
00:02:43,765 --> 00:02:44,464
Pip: Two!

49
00:02:45,264 --> 00:02:46,149
Lulu: Three!

50
00:02:46,949 --> 00:02:47,350
Bruno: Four!

51
00:02:48,150 --> 00:02:49,092
Mimo: Five!

52
00:02:49,892 --> 00:02:50,992
Pip: Six!

53
00:02:51,792 --> 00:02:52,647
Lulu: Seven!

54
00:02:53,447 --> 00:02:53,756
Bruno: Eight!

55
00:02:54,556 --> 00:02:55,559
Mimo: Nine!

56
00:02:56,359 --> 00:02:57,031
Pip: Ten!

57
00:02:59,131 --> 00:03:02,739
Mimo: Ten stars! We counted all the way to ten!

58
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:08,442
Mimo: Now let's count them again, all together, nice and slow. Ready?

59
00:03:08,742 --> 00:03:09,628
Mimo: One!

60
00:03:10,228 --> 00:03:10,996
Mimo: Two!

61
00:03:11,596 --> 00:03:12,457
Mimo: Three!

62
00:03:13,057 --> 00:03:13,912
Mimo: Four!

63
00:03:14,512 --> 00:03:15,454
Mimo: Five!

64
00:03:16,054 --> 00:03:17,019
Mimo: Six!

65
00:03:17,619 --> 00:03:18,610
Mimo: Seven!

66
00:03:19,210 --> 00:03:20,055
Mimo: Eight!

67
00:03:20,655 --> 00:03:21,657
Mimo: Nine!

68
00:03:22,257 --> 00:03:23,069
Mimo: Ten!

69
00:03:23,669 --> 00:03:26,283
Mimo: Ten! Great job, friends!

70
00:03:28,383 --> 00:03:31,544
Bruno: All this counting makes me sleepy... One sheep, two sheep...

71
00:03:33,444 --> 00:03:36,360
Pip: Wake up, Bruno! We have one more counting game!

72
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:46,036
Mimo: We can count backwards too! From ten all the way down to one. Then... BLAST OFF!

73
00:03:46,336 --> 00:03:48,011
Pip: Everybody into the rocket!

74
00:03:54,441 --> 00:03:56,526
Mimo: Count with us! Ready?

75
00:03:56,826 --> 00:03:57,637
Mimo: Ten!

76
00:03:58,237 --> 00:03:59,030
Pip: Nine!

77
00:03:59,630 --> 00:04:00,379
Lulu: Eight!

78
00:04:00,979 --> 00:04:01,660
Bruno: Seven!

79
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:03,226
Mimo: Six!

80
00:04:03,826 --> 00:04:04,525
Pip: Five!

81
00:04:05,125 --> 00:04:05,884
Lulu: Four!

82
00:04:06,484 --> 00:04:07,252
Bruno: Three!

83
00:04:07,852 --> 00:04:08,620
Mimo: Two!

84
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:10,093
Pip: One!

85
00:04:10,693 --> 00:04:12,065
Mimo: BLAST OFF!

86
00:04:17,965 --> 00:04:24,873
Mimo: Wheee! What a trip! Great counting, friends! You can count to ten AND back down again!

87
00:04:26,473 --> 00:04:29,200
Lulu: Next time, let's learn our shapes!

88
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:32,615
Bruno: Can we count cookies next time? Mmm, cookies.

89
00:04:34,915 --> 00:04:36,804
Mimo: Bye bye, friends!
